# design-taste-frontend

For public-facing pages (landing, marketing, portfolio, product page, hero), follow the project skill at `.cursor/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md` (same copy in `.agents/skills/design-taste-frontend/`).

Do the run in order: brief → argument → `node .cursor/skills/design-taste-frontend/scripts/draw.mjs` → house style → inspect → assets → look-and-fix.

Do **not** apply this skill to dashboards, master-data forms, or sales app screens in this repo (`/dashboard`, `/app`, MUI entity pages). Those stay product UI.
